===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|south}}, from {{inh|en|ang|sūþ}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*sunþr}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*sunþrą}}. Compare {{cog|fy|súd}}, {{cog|nl|zuid}}, {{cog|de|Süd}}, {{cog|da|syd}}.

